# Gmail SMTP credentials for sending RSVP + message emails
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-gmail-app-password
CONTACT_EMAIL=your-email@gmail.com

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace the values with your actual credentials
# 3. For Gmail: enable 2FA and generate an App Password at https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 4. Never commit .env to git
# 5. Run "npm run dev:all" to start both the site and the email server together
